         "281",
         "A Bill in the District of Columbia to prohibit users of algorithmic decision-making from utilizing algorithmic eligibility determinations in a discriminatory manner, to require corresponding notices to individuals whose personal information is used, and to provide for appropriate means of civil enforcement.",
         "Stop Discrimination by Algorithms Act of 2023",
         "https://lims.dccouncil.gov/downloads/LIMS/52282/Introduction/B25-0114-Introduction.pdf?Id=155626",
         "District of Columbia",
         "U.S. state and local laws",
         "Proposed",
